{"id":"wb-6-570","name":"南屏村古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南屏村","text":"南屏村位于中国安徽省黟县碧阳镇西部，是以叶姓为主、兼有程姓、李姓等姓氏的血缘聚落，2008年被列为中国历史文化名村，南屏村古建筑群于2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n南屏村始建于北宋，占地面积16.2万平方米，现存三百多幢明清建筑，仅祠堂就有八座。村内主要建筑有叙秩堂、叶奎光堂、孝思楼、敦睦堂、慎思堂、倚南别墅、叶姜生宅、冰凌阁、半春园等。\n米其林旅游指南将南屏村这座大山脚下的白色村落评为“不可错过”（Recommended）级别。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E5%B1%8F%E6%9D%91","revisionId":92171378,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92171378","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/451d80df30045098e94a5005.jpg","title":"The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Ye_in_Nanping_2013-04.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Ye_in_Nanping_2013-04.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Ye_in_Nanping_2013-04.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"(Cat's diary) 猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​黟县南屏村叶氏支祠大门。","width":320,"height":240}}